UID:10002860-1781868600-1781888400@visitdavis.org
SUMMARY:Pence Gallery Treasure Sale
DESCRIPTION:Pence Gallery Treasure Sale in Davis \nJune 19-22\, 11:30 AM – 5 PM (closes at 3 PM on June 22) \nOur annual Treasure Sale is a great event for those who are looking to downsize their unwanted family heirlooms\, or pick up a few new treasures. On the last day of the sale only (Monday\, June 22\, 11:30 AM – 3 PM)\, bring your own bag to fill it up for $5! \n  \nMembers Only Preview: June 18\, 4-6 PM \nCurrent Pence Members can join us for special pre-sale shopping hours on Thursday\, June 18\, from 4-6 PM! Not a Member? You can become a Member at pencegallery.org\, or sign up at the door in order to participate. \n  \nDonation drop-off dates: June 13-17\, 11:30 AM – 4:30 PM \nIf you would like to donate jewelry\, vintage or retro-inspired clothing\, fine art\, small furniture\, rugs\, collectibles\, and more\, we encourage you to bring them by! No need to call before drop-off during these dates\, and all donations will receive a tax donation form. Please note that we are NOT accepting: glassware\, worn out clothing\, large frames and furniture\, books\, kitchen gadgets\, exercise equipment\, electronics\, or broken items. Thank you! \n  \nAll proceeds from this sale\, which takes place at the Gallery\, support the Pence’s exhibits and education programs.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/pence-gallery-treasure-sale/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Treasure-sale2026-front-F8VfZp.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
